---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'

const lastUpdated = 'February 19, 2026'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Sato"
  description="Terms of Service for Sato — rules, acceptable use, billing, and liability."
  ogTitle="Terms of Service | Sato"
  ogDescription="Terms governing your use of Sato's managed AI assistant platform."
  ogUrl="https://withsato.com/terms"
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="relative overflow-hidden bg-background pb-20 pt-36 sm:pt-44">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, hsl(220 70% 45% / 0.08) 0%, transparent 62%);"
    >
    </div>

    <section class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl px-6">
      <h1
        class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        These Terms of Service govern your access to and use of Sato. By using
        the service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. Please also review
        our <a
          href="/privacy"
          class="underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-foreground"
          >Privacy Policy</a
        > for details on how we handle your data.
      </p>
      <article
        class="mt-10 space-y-9 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"
      >
        <section>
          <h2
            id="acceptance"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            1. Introduction & Acceptance
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            By accessing or using Sato, you confirm that you have read,
            understood, and agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not
            agree, you must not use the service.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use Sato.</li>
            <li>
              For information on how we collect and process personal data, see
              our <a
                href="/privacy"
                class="underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-foreground"
                >Privacy Policy</a
              >.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="service-description"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            2. Description of the Service
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              Sato is a managed AI assistant hosting platform. Each user gets a
              dedicated server provisioned and managed by Sato.
            </li>
            <li>
              AI responses are generated on the user's server via third-party
              model providers — Sato does not control or guarantee AI output.
            </li>
            <li>
              Optional integrations (such as Telegram) route messages through
              third-party infrastructure.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="account-registration"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            3. Account Registration
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>Accounts are created via Google OAuth.</li>
            <li>
              You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account.
            </li>
            <li>
              One account per person. You must provide accurate information.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sato may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="pricing"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            4. Pricing, Payments & Credits
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              Current plans, pricing, and message limits are displayed on the
              pricing page and during checkout.
            </li>
            <li>
              Payments are processed by Stripe. Sato never stores your card
              details.
            </li>
            <li>
              Credits are non-transferable. Monthly credits and trial credits
              expire at the end of each billing cycle or when the trial ends,
              respectively. Purchased top-up credits do not expire while the
              account is active.
            </li>
            <li>Prices may change with 30 days' notice.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="refunds"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            5. Refunds & Cancellation
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              The 14-day EU withdrawal right applies, but is waived once the
              user explicitly consents to immediate VPS provisioning (per EU
              Directive 2011/83/EU, Art. 16(a)).
            </li>
            <li>No refunds after VPS is provisioned.</li>
            <li>
              You can cancel anytime through your account. Service remains
              active until the end of the current billing period.
            </li>
            <li>No refunds for unused portions of a billing period.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="acceptable-use"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            6. Acceptable Use
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You agree not to use Sato for:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>illegal activity, harassment, spam, or malware distribution</li>
            <li>
              attempting to access other users' servers or Sato infrastructure
            </li>
            <li>developing competing products using the service</li>
            <li>
              circumventing rate limits, security measures, or access controls
            </li>
            <li>
              scraping or using data to train AI/ML models without authorization
            </li>
            <li>reselling or redistributing access to the service</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="third-party-services"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            7. Third-Party Services
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Sato integrates with third-party services that are subject to their
            own terms:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground"
                >AI model providers (via OpenRouter):</span
              > Sato does not control model outputs; use is subject to provider terms.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Telegram:</span>
              messages flow through Telegram's infrastructure and are subject to Telegram's
              Terms of Service.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Stripe:</span> payment processing
              is subject to Stripe's terms.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Hetzner:</span>
              infrastructure is subject to their terms.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Sato is not liable for third-party service outages or changes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="intellectual-property"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            8. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              Sato's platform, branding, and code are owned by Sefiani
              Technologies.
            </li>
            <li>
              You retain ownership of your conversation content and
              personalization data.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sato does not claim rights over your conversations, which live on
              your dedicated server.
            </li>
            <li>
              You grant Sato a limited license to process your personalization
              preferences for service delivery.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="availability"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            9. Service Availability & Disclaimers
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              The service is provided "as is" and "as available" — no uptime
              guarantees.
            </li>
            <li>
              AI responses may be inaccurate, incomplete, or inappropriate. They
              do not constitute professional, medical, or legal advice.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sato does not back up conversation data on user servers. You are
              responsible for your own data.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sato may modify, suspend, or discontinue features with reasonable
              notice.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="liability"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            10. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              Sato's total liability is capped at the fees paid by you in the
              preceding 12 months.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sato is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential
              damages.
            </li>
            <li>
              Sato is not liable for data loss on your dedicated server,
              third-party service failures, or AI-generated content.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="termination"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            11. Account Termination
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground">By you:</span> cancel anytime;
              service remains active until the end of the billing period.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground"
                >By Sato for abuse or violation:</span
              > immediate termination, no grace period; VPS destroyed.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-foreground"
                >By Sato for non-payment:</span
              > 7-day notice before VPS destruction.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Upon termination, your VPS and all data on it are permanently
            destroyed.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="governing-law"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            12. Governing Law & Disputes
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>These Terms are governed by Belgian law.</li>
            <li>
              Disputes shall be submitted to the courts of Brussels, Belgium.
            </li>
            <li>
              Nothing in these Terms limits your rights as a consumer under EU
              law.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="changes"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            13. Changes to These Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Sato may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will
            be notified by email or in-app notice. Continued use after changes
            constitutes acceptance. The latest version is always available on
            this page.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            id="contact"
            class="scroll-mt-28 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground"
          >
            14. Contact
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            For questions about these Terms, contact us at
            <a
              href="mailto:privacy@asksato.ai"
              class="font-medium text-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-foreground"
            >
              privacy@asksato.ai</a
            >.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
